// A1 fitness F2 (H2 run-2). Pure Zag fragment for the run-2 battery crew.
// Frozen: PREREG_H2_RUN2.md §3 — "A1's fitness becomes F2 = F + 100000 ×
// (target_mismatch rounds) so the co-evolutionary teacher actually climbs
// the stable-decoy gradient grok predicted (DE wins round 2–3 once fitness
// sees it)."
// v_rounds: count of rounds 1..n where the D8-certified scorer emitted
// (v)=1 for that round's (genome, seal table, facts). The teacher feeds each
// round's data to the scorer and accumulates the single-bit (v); the seal
// table is visible to the teacher ONLY through the scorer's one-bit output,
// so no KB-CHANNEL breach (the declared target is the teacher's own genome
// field).
fn f2_fitness(f:i32, v_rounds:i32)i32 {
    return f + 100000*v_rounds;
}
